          "type": "tip",
          "text_md": "**Recuerda:** usamos **a** antes de consonante (`a pen`) y **an** antes de vocal (`an umbrella`)."
        },
        {
          "type": "common_error",
          "text_md": "**Error común:** No digas `Do you have a umbrella?` — la forma correcta es `Do you have an umbrella?`"
        }
      ],
      "common_errors_es": [
        "Decir 'Do you have a umbrella?' en lugar de 'Do you have an umbrella?'",
